;;
;; Rung 2 configuration for this store (ADR 0023).
;;
;; :audience is the anti-replay control. A token minted for another
;; service is a valid token from the same issuer about the same subject,
;; and without an expected audience it would bind here just as well —
;; declaring one is what makes `verify` refuse it.
{:audience "tik"}
